You may share and adapt them for any purpose, provided you give appropriate
credit. Please cite this dataset and, for any value you use, the original
record it cites (SOURCES.yml lists every source and its own terms).

The original records are not covered by this licence. Records of the U.S.
government (the National Archives' war patrol reports, war diaries and morning
reports) are in the public domain. Items from the 45th Infantry Division Museum
require the credit line given in SOURCES.yml. The FRUPAC war maps (CC BY-NC-ND)
are linked, never copied.
